title: DDP Media
new-page: true

# Ripped from Cascadian Ptriot's amazing DDP mod

@media
title: Media
view-if: ddp_media_timer <= 0 and ddp_rally_timer > 0 and (labor_minister_party != "DDP" or labor_affairs_post_timer != 0 or strike_term_seen_post_timer != 0)

The DDP will invest in liberal media

- @berlinertagblad
- @diehilfe
- @echoderjungedemokratie
- @integrate1
- @debate

@berlinertagblad
title: The DDP will fund the Berliner Tageblatt
subtitle: -1 resource. The biggest left-liberal publisher in Germany, edited by prominent DDP member Theodor Wolff.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.ddp_resources >= 1) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!} 

The DDP has funded the Berliner Tageblatt, and with its wide circulation, we see a noticeable increase in support for the DDP and for democracy.

@diehilfe
title: The DDP will fund Die Hilfe.
subtitle: -1 resource, edited by herr Fredrich Naumann himself.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and dh_integrated == 0

Funding Die Hilfe certainly benefits the DDP, as the editors are their most loyal members.

@echoderjungedemokratie
title: The DDP will fund the Echo der Junge Demokratie.
subtitle: -1 resource, the newspaper of their Youth wing, herr Ludwig Quidde also publishes his writings here.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and edjd_integrated == 0

The DDP have supported their youth wing's newspaper, to which they have responded with enthusiasm, and with its circulation, support for pacifism has grown within the party.

@integrate1
title: The DDP will integrate Die Hilfe into their newspaper.
subtitle: -1 resource. 
view-if: ddp_resources >= 1 and newspaper_founded = 1 and dh_integrated = 0 and (newspaper_editor = "Erkelenz" or newspaper_editor = "Heuss")

The DDP has integrated Die Hilfe into their newspaper network, growing its influence significantly, and bringing with it funding and popularity.

@integrate2
title: The DDP will integrate Echo der Junge Demokratie into their newspaper.
subtitle: [? if young_democrats < 3 : -2 resources ?][? if young_democrats >= 3 : -1 resource, their investments into Echo der Junge Demokratie has reduced the cost ?]
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1 and edjd_integrated = 0 and (newspaper_editor = "Erkelenz" or newspaper_editor = "Quidde")

THE DDP has integrated Echo der Junge Demokratie into their newspaper network, growing the influence of pacifism within the party.

@bolsterpartymedia
title: The DDP will continue to develop their newspaper network.
subtitle: [? if newspaper_invested_in >= 3 : -1 resource. ?][? if newspaper_invested_in < 3 : It is now financially self-sufficient and doesn't require further resources to grow. ?]
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1

The DDP's newspaper network has a mix of popular and political programming, and is proving a success in spreading our meseage.

@debate
title: The DDP will have vibrant ideological debates in their party newspaper.
view-if: newspaper_founded = 1

The DDP's hosting of ideological debates within their party newspaper has successfully paved over the many tensions within their party.

@partymedia
title: The DDP will create their own official media
subtitle: -2 resources.
view-if: ddp_resources >= 2 and newspaper_founded = 0

We have founded our own newspaper, and we must now select its head editor.

- @heuss
- @quide
- @erkelenz

@heuss
title: Theodor Heuss, a rising star with a patriotic attitute.
view-if: ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_industrialist_strength > ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The right has managed to apoint Theodor Heuss to the position of chief editor.

@quide
title: Ludwig Quidde, notable pacifist.
view-if: (ddp_labor_strength + ddp_liberal_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_industrialist_strength) and not (ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_industrialist_strength + ddp_liberal_strength)

Ludiwg quide has been apointed chief editor.

@erkelenz
title: Anton Erkelenz, the labour leader.
view-if: ddp_labor_strength > ddp_regionalist_strength + ddp_industrialist_strength + ddp_liberal_strength

The left has managed to apoint Anton Erkelenz to he position of cheif editor.|